  "rewrites": {
   "11": {
    "original": "It's just like the normal mafia but online and I'm reminded of that famous Nintendo 64 game \"Conker Live and Reloaded\" but without the \"bino cop\" parts.",
    "rewrite": "It resembles a digital equivalent of the traditional mafia but without the \"bino cop\" segments, and it makes me think of the classic Nintendo 64 game \"Conker Live and Reloaded\"."
   },
   "13": {
    "original": "Lots of fun trying to figure out who your friends (possible!) mafia were and the like, and this is the type of game you want to play: group style.",
    "rewrite": "Enjoying the challenge of identifying your friends' mafia roles and other similar games is what you'll do best in this group-playing game."
   },
   "7": {
    "original": "So it's our pleasure to provide you entertainment for your family.If you need any support or information, our email contact information is below.",
    "rewrite": "We are delighted to offer entertainment for your family. Should you require any support or have questions, our email contact details are listed below."
   },
   "1": {
