   },
   "10": {
    "original": "\"Mafia Boss: Town Hall\" the new social networking app from IVPN is pretty simple to use.",
    "rewrite": "\"Mafia Boss: Town Hall,\" the newly released social networking app by IVPN, is quite user-friendly."
   },
