  "final_span": "time, the Mafia secretly tries to eliminate the Townspeople who wont be able to identify the Mafia as themselves in the voting.As the Mafia, you take this name for your group name, and create an account with a password. You can play every night at any location by logging into your Mafia game from your iPhone, and you have an avatar to represent yourself. You can personalize the image of your Mafia using a straightforward in-built editor for your avatar. To participate in the game at the forum, you must join the Mafia group to prove your identity. The group forum titled \"PlayMafia\" is a place where you can talk about any aspects of the game. As the game is played, both the Townspeople and the Mafia will send messages to each other in order to carry out their individual goals, be it trapping and voting off suspected Mafia members or completing their \"disturbances\" before they are found out and spotted.About RenovaMinfony is three independent software houses in one team bringing you quality software for the Mac for the past 7 years. We have developed numerous titles for you to enjoy; they have been kid tested and mother approved. We are delighted to offer entertainment for your family. Should you require any support or have questions, our email contact details are listed below. We offer comprehensive technical support and would like to hear your feedback. While our software offers multiple applications, it cannot replace the role of a Computer Consultant.\n\"Mafia Boss: Town Hall,\" the newly released social networking app by IVPN, is quite user-friendly. It resembles a digital equivalent of the traditional mafia but without the \"bino cop\" segments, and it makes me think of the classic Nintendo 64 game \"Conker Live and Reloaded\". I haven't played any online mafia with others before, but why not try it? Enjoying the challenge of identifying your friends' mafia roles and other similar games is what you'll do best in this group-playing game. The networked component, not the game called \"Mafia.\" OK, the game of \"Mafia\" is quite fun, too! I played a few games and generally had a useful and",
